  title: Top secret experiment resume
  content: "\u2116:  0313\n\nRisks:\n\nAverage mortality\n\nMutations:\n\nAfter verification,
    mutations were noted as: depletion, loss vision, rapid growth and change in the
    appearance of nails (they became similar to wooden pegs), change in skin color.
    At the same time, the creature's hearing became better, reacting to any rustle.
    It was decided to close the creature for a while in a capsule\n\nResults\n\nAfter
    the experiment, the following conclusions were made: out of 10 test subjects,
    5 survived, and the virus took root and completely controlled three of them.
    1 of the test subjects escaped. The others had to be isolated in capsules to
    prevent escapes and attacks on staff"
